{
  "name": "Landvoice - Save Account Export",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Landvoice - Save Account Export (sub-workflow)\n\nCalled by **Landvoice - Daily Lead Export** once per account after its Apify run finished. Do not run it on its own.\n\n**Input (one item):** `runId`, `datasetId`, `clientName`, `email`, `status` (Apify run status), `statusMessage`, `dateFolderId`, `exportDate`.\n\n**Does:** reads the actor result; if files were exported, finds or creates `<date folder>/<Client Name>` in Drive and saves each CSV there as a native Google Sheet.\n\n**Returns:** exactly one Run Log row (the output of *Build Run Log Row*).\n\n**Setup:** select the `Apify API Token` credential on *Get Run Result* and your Google Drive OAuth2 credential on the three Drive nodes.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -420
      ],
      "id": "819c27fa-0b62-4f36-8b1c-ff3182b5364a",
      "name": "Sticky Note 1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Actor result\nOnly runs that SUCCEEDED have a result to read. Anything else (failed / timed out / aborted) goes straight to the log.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -300
      ],
      "id": "d5ba9246-2bda-432b-8c06-432983d4ba7f",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Client folder (find or create)\nLooks for a folder named after the client inside today's date folder and creates it if missing, so re-runs on the same day reuse it.",
